description = "Skills capped by the gear (Phase 229): a combat ability needs an equipped weapon of its tier, and a recipe needs a tool and a crafting station of its tier. Empty hands and a missing tool count as novice gear, so novice abilities and recipes need nothing. Skill XP grows with any gear; only use is capped. No weapon reaches these abilities yet: Archery.executePierceShot (expert), Shieldcraft.executeShieldBash (journeyman), Shieldcraft.activateFortify (expert)."
